    {
      "id": 4080,
      "sender_id": 71,
      "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"28\">Terence Tao</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/13-Math-Distillation-Challenge---equational-theories/topic/Sharing.20thoughts.20and.20experiences/near/4064\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks to everyone who participated in the Math Distillation Challenge!  We hope to run final evaluations and publish the results soon.</p>\n<p>In the meantime, I'd like to open this thread for people to share their experiences in this competition, and give any feedback on how to improve the experience for future competitions.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Thank you Terence  &amp; SAIR team, I really enjoyed this..</p>\n<p>One unexpected outcome for me was transferring some of the Stage 2 learnings to the Lean Kernel Arena, where our Lean kernel subsequently reached #1 and is currently ~18× faster than the official Lean checker. We've only just started applying the learnings there and elsewhere, so the cross-benchmark transfer is particularly interesting.</p>\n<p>Would definitely love to participate again and looking forward to future challenges.</p>",
